title: 'statement-store: drop explicit-affine statements once affinity lapses'

doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    On nodes running the v2 DHT statement path, statements persisted only for explicit
    topic affinity are now dropped during store maintenance once no affinity covers them,
    typically after the last matching RPC subscription ends. The removal skips the
    re-acceptance ban, so peers may redeliver a dropped statement should affinity return.
    Configured-topic and DHT-affine statements, and nodes with the v2 gate off, are
    unaffected.

crates:
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: minor
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
